WEBVTT

00:00:26.208 --> 00:00:29.125
MISSION 2
STAB YOUR DOG EYES BLIND

00:00:31.166 --> 00:00:32.958
Tomorrow, we'll be at war
with the mad dogs.

00:00:33.041 --> 00:00:34.375
MEOW KITTY - CHIEF OF CATS
SKILL: CATERINE CLAW

00:00:34.458 --> 00:00:35.791
Have you figured out a way
to fight with them?

00:00:36.541 --> 00:00:38.708
The way I see it,
we might as well surrender.

00:00:41.916 --> 00:00:43.375
Or send them some civet coffee?

00:00:46.750 --> 00:00:48.625
Hey, I didn't even say anything!

00:00:48.708 --> 00:00:50.000
I found a small card on the ground,

00:00:50.083 --> 00:00:51.500
like those tossed
at the door of a hotel room.

00:00:51.583 --> 00:00:53.541
But it's not about any hooker.
It's from a killer.

00:00:53.625 --> 00:00:56.208
We may hire him
to kill the chief of those dogs.

00:00:57.916 --> 00:01:00.041
Scissor Seven.

00:01:22.916 --> 00:01:25.958
-As a professional killer--
-First, you have to move your foot.

00:01:26.041 --> 00:01:27.833
-You're stepping on my tail.
-Sorry.

00:01:29.708 --> 00:01:31.291
As a professional killer,

00:01:31.375 --> 00:01:34.958
-I never ask why, only when and where.
-Before sunrise.

00:01:35.041 --> 00:01:36.291
Headquarters of the dogs.

00:01:37.250 --> 00:01:39.916
The target is their chief.

00:01:40.000 --> 00:01:43.291
No problem.
I'll kill this fucking dog before sunrise.

00:01:43.791 --> 00:01:47.250
I don't want you to kill him,
only to stab his eyes.

00:01:47.333 --> 00:01:48.791
Okay, as you wish!

00:01:48.875 --> 00:01:50.041
HEADQUARTERS OF THE DOGS

00:02:01.166 --> 00:02:03.500
So well-guarded.
I have to figure out a way.

00:02:25.791 --> 00:02:28.583
<i>What are these dumb dogs</i>
<i>doing up at night?</i>

00:02:29.625 --> 00:02:32.333
<i>Wow, every one of them looks savage.</i>

00:02:32.416 --> 00:02:34.875
But they don't scare me.
All I have to do is secretly...

00:02:40.750 --> 00:02:42.458
Who threw the ball at me?

00:02:52.291 --> 00:02:53.666
Who was it this time?

00:02:54.208 --> 00:02:55.750
Frisbee?

00:03:08.000 --> 00:03:08.833
Again?

00:03:25.916 --> 00:03:29.333
Wow, it's really dangerous here.
I barely saved my ass.

00:03:29.416 --> 00:03:31.875
As a professional killer,
I won't be put off by this.

00:03:31.958 --> 00:03:34.333
No big deal. I can move along on my back.

00:03:35.458 --> 00:03:37.958
What are you looking at?
Have you never seen a man lying or what?

00:03:48.125 --> 00:03:50.750
<i>Could he be the chief of dogs?</i>

00:03:55.333 --> 00:03:57.000
<i>They are not in the same style.</i>

00:03:58.625 --> 00:04:01.458
-Bosses, be cool.
-What's your name?

00:04:01.541 --> 00:04:05.333
-I've never seen you before.
-My name is Mad Doggie.

00:04:05.416 --> 00:04:06.916
Every dog here is surnamed Bark.

00:04:07.000 --> 00:04:08.083
STUPID BARK

00:04:08.166 --> 00:04:09.958
There's no Mad Doggie or whatever.

00:04:10.041 --> 00:04:14.833
Mad Doggie is my nickname.
My real name is Mad Bark.

00:04:15.416 --> 00:04:18.708
-You're Mad Bark?
-Yes, I am.

00:04:33.416 --> 00:04:37.000
Every dog knows
there is only one Mad Bark here: me.

00:04:37.083 --> 00:04:38.875
MAD BARK - CHIEF OF DOGS
SKILL: ROCK DOG

00:04:39.833 --> 00:04:44.041
Besides, why do you smell of human?

00:04:45.166 --> 00:04:47.708
Are you a fake?

00:04:48.291 --> 00:04:49.250
SMART BARK

00:04:49.333 --> 00:04:52.291
Boss, I know a way to test
if he's really a dog.

00:04:52.875 --> 00:04:56.416
As the saying goes, a dog can never change
the habit of eating shit.

00:04:56.500 --> 00:04:58.583
If you're a dog, take a bite.

00:04:59.166 --> 00:05:00.708
<i>Is he serious?</i>

00:05:01.500 --> 00:05:02.791
Come on, while it's still hot.

00:05:04.166 --> 00:05:05.458
You go first.

00:05:10.166 --> 00:05:11.291
Shit on you!

00:05:21.416 --> 00:05:22.875
STAB YOUR DOG EYES BLIND

00:05:26.291 --> 00:05:29.250
Sorry, I'm a killer.

00:05:31.083 --> 00:05:35.750
Ouch, ouch, ouch!
Wait. Didn't I just stab your eyes?

00:05:36.500 --> 00:05:38.083
These are my eyes.

00:05:38.666 --> 00:05:41.666
The glasses were on my forehead.

00:05:41.750 --> 00:05:44.791
What trick was that?

00:05:44.875 --> 00:05:45.875
SNEAK ATTACK!

00:05:48.458 --> 00:05:49.541
Who sent you here?

00:05:50.416 --> 00:05:53.708
As a professional killer, I will never...

00:05:55.500 --> 00:06:00.000
Okay, okay. I'll tell you alone.
Don't tell anyone else.

00:06:00.083 --> 00:06:01.000
Actually...

00:06:02.208 --> 00:06:05.458
Mercy! Mercy!
I'll never do it again. Just let me go.

00:06:06.000 --> 00:06:08.125
I wanna go home.

00:06:08.708 --> 00:06:11.208
Tell me who sent you here, or I'll kill...

00:06:11.291 --> 00:06:13.916
YOGA KILL

00:06:14.000 --> 00:06:16.541
I also practiced Yoga for months.

00:06:17.541 --> 00:06:20.333
No! Ouch, ouch, ouch.

00:06:23.291 --> 00:06:24.250
Tell me, or I'll...

00:06:26.875 --> 00:06:29.625
As a professional killer,

00:06:30.250 --> 00:06:32.791
I'll stab your eyes anyway.

00:06:32.875 --> 00:06:36.083
You really pissed me off now.

00:08:02.041 --> 00:08:03.333
What just happened?

00:08:18.875 --> 00:08:20.958
How did you get this picture?

00:08:21.041 --> 00:08:23.916
This is my pet dog.

00:08:24.000 --> 00:08:26.458
Did Meow send you here?

00:08:27.708 --> 00:08:31.083
At that time, I was just a stray dog
singing for a living.

00:08:31.166 --> 00:08:32.916
No one is interested in your past.

00:08:33.875 --> 00:08:36.625
<i>And she was a cute cat.</i>

00:08:36.708 --> 00:08:39.458
<i>She came and listened</i>
<i>to my singing every day.</i>

00:08:39.541 --> 00:08:42.416
<i>Soon, we fell in love.</i>

00:08:42.500 --> 00:08:47.125
If you love someone else instead of me,
I'll stab your eyes.

00:08:51.083 --> 00:08:54.583
So, you fell in love with others and
she sent me here to stab your eyes.

00:08:54.666 --> 00:08:55.958
I didn't love anyone but her.

00:09:00.375 --> 00:09:02.500
I left her because...

00:09:04.333 --> 00:09:09.041
<i>Scientific research shows that</i>
<i>cats and dogs cannot breed,</i>

00:09:09.125 --> 00:09:11.291
<i>because they are different species.</i>

00:09:11.375 --> 00:09:14.000
Look at this kitten, how cute she is!

00:09:14.083 --> 00:09:17.041
How many kittens would you like to have?

00:09:17.125 --> 00:09:18.291
Oh, no.

00:09:18.375 --> 00:09:20.458
A wife should always
go along with her husband.

00:09:20.541 --> 00:09:22.875
So it should be,
how many puppies would you like?

00:09:24.583 --> 00:09:27.625
<i>I left her for her own good.</i>

00:09:27.708 --> 00:09:30.250
Your story is so bloody dramatic.

00:09:32.333 --> 00:09:37.083
All I know is that she'll never know what
you're thinking if you don't tell her.

00:09:43.916 --> 00:09:48.000
Do you think you're the hero
of some tragic drama, you idiot?

00:09:50.166 --> 00:09:53.125
Wow, he ran. Bow-wow.

00:10:13.791 --> 00:10:20.666
<i>I once loved a cat</i>

00:10:21.583 --> 00:10:28.166
<i>She had the most charming smile</i>

00:10:29.458 --> 00:10:36.125
<i>I dreamed of loving her forever and ever</i>

00:10:37.083 --> 00:10:42.958
<i>But I didn't fit in her dream</i>

00:10:46.041 --> 00:10:50.166
<i>So, I decided to leave her</i>

00:10:53.708 --> 00:10:57.958
<i>Regretting and suffering</i>
<i>From misunderstanding</i>

00:11:01.500 --> 00:11:06.416
<i>I miss her so fondly, oh...</i>

00:11:09.166 --> 00:11:14.208
<i>But she hated me</i>

00:11:17.208 --> 00:11:22.833
<i>Dear girl, I didn't want to leave you</i>

00:11:23.875 --> 00:11:30.458
<i>Wailing in pain</i>

00:11:32.208 --> 00:11:38.333
<i>Dear girl, please forgive me</i>

00:11:39.333 --> 00:11:46.250
<i>I'm such a dumb, dumb, dumb dog</i>

00:11:49.416 --> 00:11:55.791
Meow, I left you
because cats and dogs can't breed.

00:11:56.375 --> 00:11:59.208
Actually, I have never loved anyone else.

00:12:00.875 --> 00:12:02.875
Mad Bark, you're lying.

00:12:02.958 --> 00:12:06.208
In my heart, you're the only one I love.

00:12:07.458 --> 00:12:08.625
You're lying.

00:12:11.041 --> 00:12:12.666
You're lying!

00:12:13.791 --> 00:12:15.333
You're lying!

00:12:21.583 --> 00:12:28.291
<i>I love you</i>
<i>I wanted to give you everything</i>

00:12:29.375 --> 00:12:36.041
<i>We are from different worlds</i>

00:12:37.083 --> 00:12:43.750
<i>You want to have a baby</i>

00:12:44.708 --> 00:12:50.500
<i>But I couldn't help you fulfill it</i>

00:12:53.875 --> 00:12:58.541
<i>I chose to leave you</i>

00:13:01.625 --> 00:13:05.916
<i>Not to hurt you</i>

00:13:09.208 --> 00:13:15.750
<i>In my heart, oh...</i>

00:13:15.833 --> 00:13:21.500
<i>My love for you is growing</i>

00:13:24.833 --> 00:13:31.000
<i>Dear girl, I won't leave you again</i>

00:13:31.583 --> 00:13:38.166
<i>I won't hurt you again</i>

00:13:40.041 --> 00:13:45.666
<i>Dear girl, don't let me go</i>

00:13:47.083 --> 00:13:53.875
<i>Tell me, tell me, tell me</i>
<i>You still love me</i>

00:13:55.666 --> 00:14:02.416
<i>Dear girl, I didn't want to leave you</i>

00:14:02.500 --> 00:14:08.500
<i>Wailing in pain</i>

00:14:11.083 --> 00:14:18.000
<i>Dear girl, please forgive me</i>
